"Reduced normal form of the 4-move centipede game with the incomplete-
information altruism model of :cite:p:`McKPal92`, Section 4.1 (Appendix A,
Figure 8), with each player independently altruistic with probability 1/20.
This fixed parameterization is kept as an illustrative example, since Gambit's
file formats do not yet support symbolic payoffs or probabilities."

